Honored the `frontendOptions` schema hint when rendering a field in the default views, so a field declared with `directives.widget(..., frontendOptions={"widget": ..., "widgetProps": {...}})` is rendered by that widget, with those props, instead of falling back to the default one. The `views` registry gained a `factory` mapping and entries for `title` and `description` by field id, so widget resolution now mirrors the edit side. @ericof
